WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:17.870
<i>hoshi ga furishikiru penthouse de
In the penthouse that watches the stars fall...</i>

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>sora no ORUGO-RU hitori kiiteta
I listened to Heaven's music box...</i>

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:30.460
<i>GARASU no RO-PU wo mekakushi de wataru
Walking, blindfolded, across a tight-rope of glass...</i>

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:37.090
<i>minna sabishii SA-KASU no kodomo sa
Everyone is like, the lonely child of the circus.</i>

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:45.020
<i>hitori bocchi no kanashimi ni
The rope that creaks with the sadness of isolation...</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:50.770
<i>kishinda tsuna ga kokoro de yureteru...
...is still locked deep in my heart...</i>

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>yasashii me wo shita dareka ni aitai
I wish to meet the one who's eyes glow with warmth!</i>

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:25.980
<i>sasayaite kureyo soba ni iruyotte Silent Voice
Whisper to me that you'll always be there by my side, Silent Voice.</i>

00:01:34.410 --> 00:01:36.940
After shaking off an enemy
unlike any we'd yet encountered,

00:01:36.940 --> 00:01:38.900
the Argama came to Dublin.

00:01:38.900 --> 00:01:42.740
We had to, so that we could protest
the guys trying to have us disarm.

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:44.990
I made my own protest
without using my mouth,

00:01:44.990 --> 00:01:47.070
and almost ended up
getting smoked!

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:51.180
But, who should
save us, but Fa Yuiry!

00:01:51.180 --> 00:01:53.500
It was really moving!

00:01:55.330 --> 00:01:59.460
KAMILLE'S VOICE

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:18.690
Why isn't the Argama moving?!

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:21.270
They can't move without
the captain, right?

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:28.570
Why are you stopping?!

00:02:28.570 --> 00:02:32.870
The city! I'm worried about
Kamille! I'm going back to the city!

00:02:32.870 --> 00:02:34.450
He's still in bad shape?

00:02:34.450 --> 00:02:35.700
Yes, sir.

00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:39.250
Judau, out.
We'll let Fa use the car.

00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:40.790
But...

00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:45.600
The Argama's just over this hill.
Take care of Kamille!

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:47.680
Sorry!

00:02:55.740 --> 00:02:57.270
Ready for liftoff!

00:02:57.270 --> 00:02:58.770
Shouldn't we wait for the captain?

00:02:58.770 --> 00:03:00.390
We can pick him up later!

00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:02.480
What's keeping our
mobile-suit reinforcements?!

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:04.780
What are the rest of
you doing! Launch, already!

00:03:06.630 --> 00:03:09.700
No choice...
Iino, you're in the Hyaku Shiki!

00:03:09.700 --> 00:03:13.160
I'll pilot the Double Zeta!
Mondo, handle control!

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:14.870
Can you do this, Elle?

00:03:14.870 --> 00:03:17.960
I have to do it!
What?!

00:03:22.350 --> 00:03:25.760
I'll take the Double Zeta out!
Take care of the rest!

00:03:26.230 --> 00:03:29.260
Ple?! Don't do this!
You're not ready!

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:31.680
It's a little different
from the Qubeley, but...

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:33.590
It's okay! l can do this!

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:34.510
Oh...!

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:35.470
Now what?

00:03:35.470 --> 00:03:38.570
Iino, you take the Mega Rider!
I'll pilot the Hyaku Shiki!

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:41.570
Gotta try my best
in Judau's place!

00:03:49.630 --> 00:03:51.700
An Axis mobile suit!

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:53.110
Was it hit?

00:03:53.110 --> 00:03:54.210
Huh?!

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:56.990
Who's piloting it?!

00:03:56.990 --> 00:03:59.660
What the meaning of this?!
Why's Ple out there?

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:01.290
How should I know?

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:04.290
Enough! We're late!
Lift off, at once!

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:05.630
I am!

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:13.980
- Why is it leaving?!
- Who's moving it?!

00:04:19.160 --> 00:04:20.690
I'll shoot you down!

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:29.200
Mk. II!

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:39.910
Beecha, are you okay?!

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:43.670
Mk. II, you're finished!

00:04:45.560 --> 00:04:47.220
Move!

00:04:52.230 --> 00:04:54.890
What?!

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:59.480
Double Zeta?! Dana, grab on!

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:10.750
They've all been destroyed.
We're pulling out, Dana.

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:11.980
But...!

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:14.610
The Argama can't move
easily while it's here.

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:16.780
We'll rendezvous with the
Sandra and rebuild our forces!

00:05:16.990 --> 00:05:18.330
Right!

00:05:25.350 --> 00:05:27.840
You okay, Beecha?

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:31.500
Somehow. I guess I was
saved by Judau again.

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:32.800
You're being honest today.

00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:34.760
I always am!

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:39.430
Hey! Can the Mk. II move?

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:41.950
Ple! What are you
doing in that?!

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:44.360
Filling in for Judau!

00:05:49.330 --> 00:05:50.950
Kamille.

00:05:56.340 --> 00:05:57.910
Kamille...

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:02.960
It's still warm.
Where has he gone?

00:06:07.390 --> 00:06:09.420
Why didn't you stop Ple?

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:10.710
It happened too fast.

00:06:10.710 --> 00:06:13.420
She might go off at some
point and become our enemy.

00:06:13.420 --> 00:06:16.970
No! We still don't have the
results from the hospital, right?

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:22.300
However, just as Astonaige said,
we now know that Ple is an asset in battle.

00:06:22.510 --> 00:06:25.180
Are you going to make
her an official pilot?!

00:06:25.180 --> 00:06:26.900
Of course not.

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:31.700
Boo! So, this dress looks
good on me, doesn't it?

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:33.820
Th-That dress...!

00:06:33.820 --> 00:06:35.400
Wow, that does look nice!

00:06:35.400 --> 00:06:37.150
We found it in a closet.

00:06:37.150 --> 00:06:39.320
Elle, what are you doing?!

00:06:39.320 --> 00:06:40.200
What?

00:06:40.200 --> 00:06:43.580
That's the dress
Judau bought for Leina!

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:46.080
For Leina?

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:51.380
No, it's okay. Maybe it's
best if you wore it, Ple.

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:55.670
Judau...

00:06:55.670 --> 00:06:58.590
Captain! Military Ele-cars
are approaching us!

00:06:58.590 --> 00:06:59.800
Federal forces?

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:02.180
Looks like it.
What should we do?

00:07:02.180 --> 00:07:03.520
Wait and see.

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:12.490
Ahem...
This is the mayor of Dublin!

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:16.650
the Argama
has been confiscated!

00:07:16.650 --> 00:07:19.530
Secure your weapons and
hand it over at once!

00:07:19.530 --> 00:07:21.110
Of all the selfish...!

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:22.700
What do we do, Captain?

00:07:22.700 --> 00:07:24.910
Ignore it, of course.

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:27.700
What can the Federation
do about it now?

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:29.930
Never mind that. Hurry up
with the Argama's repairs!

00:07:29.930 --> 00:07:31.410
Oh!

00:07:31.410 --> 00:07:33.420
Hey, isn't that the
Ele-car Fa was driving?

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:35.050
What?

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:36.920
It's her!

00:07:36.920 --> 00:07:38.090
It really is.

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:40.420
- Fa!
- She's coming here?!

00:07:40.420 --> 00:07:42.010
This could be bad.

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:43.060
Judau!

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:45.800
Halt! Go no further!

00:07:45.800 --> 00:07:47.720
Why not? Let me through!

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:49.720
We can't.

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:51.810
I have relations
aboard that ship!

00:07:51.810 --> 00:07:53.600
All the more reason you can't.

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:57.040
That ship's caused Dublin
nothing but trouble!

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:59.780
You have no idea
what you're talking about!

00:08:00.030 --> 00:08:01.900
Your enemy is the Neo-Zeon!

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:04.340
- Listen, girl...
- Let me go!

00:08:04.340 --> 00:08:06.370
Grab her!

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:08.490
Let me go!

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:09.790
Stop it!

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:12.640
Let Fa go, or else I shoot!

00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:14.000
Judau.

00:08:14.000 --> 00:08:15.630
You... this is treason!

00:08:15.630 --> 00:08:16.710
Run!

00:08:16.710 --> 00:08:18.800
What do you mean,
the Argama's caused you trouble?!

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:22.260
The Neo-Zeon attacked first,
didn't they?!

00:08:22.570 --> 00:08:24.840
This land has an
independent spirit,

00:08:24.840 --> 00:08:27.930
which foreigners wouldn't
understand! If you resist...

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:29.890
Oh, shut up!

00:08:29.890 --> 00:08:32.180
- Let Fa go!
- Let her go!

00:08:32.180 --> 00:08:33.850
Next shot,
someone's getting hit!

00:08:34.100 --> 00:08:36.280
Let me go!

00:08:37.460 --> 00:08:38.870
Now get lost!

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:41.120
Stop it!

00:08:41.840 --> 00:08:43.840
Damn kids...!

00:08:43.840 --> 00:08:45.110
Sorry you feel that way.

00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:46.610
Shinta... Qum...

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:48.200
Fa!

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:51.120
Why did you leave the
Argama like that?!

00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:53.240
We missed you!

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:57.130
I'm sorry.
I'm sorry, you two.

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:00.000
Kamille's disappeared?

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:00.840
Yes, sir.

00:09:00.840 --> 00:09:03.670
So, he's able to walk
by himself now?

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:07.090
He's able to walk,

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:10.100
but he still doesn't
know what he's doing.

00:09:10.310 --> 00:09:13.680
I see.
Where would he go in that state?

00:09:13.680 --> 00:09:14.980
Who are they talking about?

00:09:14.980 --> 00:09:16.190
Dunno.

00:09:16.190 --> 00:09:19.190
I hate to ask something
so selfish of you,

00:09:19.190 --> 00:09:23.620
considering how I left the Argama,
but please find Kamille!

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:25.900
- She looks thinner, doesn't she?
- If you don't, I think we'll lose him for good!

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:27.530
- Yeah...
- If you don't, I think we'll lose him for good!

00:09:27.530 --> 00:09:28.870
- If you don't, I think we'll lose him for good!

00:09:28.870 --> 00:09:31.910
Captain! Let's find him.

00:09:31.910 --> 00:09:34.870
Kamille's important to
the Argama, isn't he?

00:09:34.870 --> 00:09:36.870
Who's Kamille?

00:09:36.870 --> 00:09:40.380
A Newtype who used to
pilot the Zeta Gundam.

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:43.810
A Newtype...
Then maybe I can find him!

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:45.720
Can you, Ple?

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:49.180
I think it'll work.
l was able to sense Leina.

00:09:49.180 --> 00:09:50.390
Captain?

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:52.310
I'm asking too, sir.

00:09:52.310 --> 00:09:55.190
We can handle the
Argama's repairs ourselves.

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:00.950
Captain...

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:04.400
Judau! Promise me
you'll find him!

00:10:04.400 --> 00:10:06.790
l hear you!

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:14.240
Roux Louka, moving out!

00:10:14.240 --> 00:10:17.210
Beecha Oleg!
Hyaku Shiki, moving out!

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:21.290
Shake a leg, Iino!

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:22.640
Gotcha!

00:10:26.860 --> 00:10:28.380
Kamille Bidan.

00:10:28.380 --> 00:10:33.230
There's a lot I'd like to ask you.
Please be okay!

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:38.520
The Gundam Team's launched!

00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:40.520
I know! I'm rushing, too!

00:10:40.520 --> 00:10:42.800
Hurry! Hurry!

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:45.990
Kamille... where are you?

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:48.400
Oh, I'm so bored!

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:49.900
What are you saying?

00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:53.250
The captain had you stay behind
out of concern for you.

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:55.490
Concern for me?

00:10:55.490 --> 00:10:56.910
Exactly.

00:10:56.910 --> 00:11:00.000
But it's not like everyone's
going into battle.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:04.010
They went to find Kamille.
SO BORED!

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:10.960
Oh, you have dirty laundry
in here, too! Shame on you!

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:13.140
Ple? What's wrong?

00:11:14.070 --> 00:11:15.730
Ple?

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:21.280
Glemy's headed for the Argama!

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:25.020
Ple!
Where are you going?!

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:28.480
Lucky for us we have the
parts for the left arm.

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:30.610
Ple, wait!

00:11:30.610 --> 00:11:32.820
This can't wait!

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:33.820
Ple!

00:11:33.820 --> 00:11:36.290
What are you doing?!
It's not repaired yet!

00:11:36.630 --> 00:11:39.500
Glemy's coming! l know he is!

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:41.260
Stop it, Ple!

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:45.710
What?
She's doing it again?

00:11:45.710 --> 00:11:47.300
What do we do, Captain?

00:11:47.300 --> 00:11:49.420
Damn her!

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:52.100
Elpeo Ple, launching
to smash the Sandra!

00:11:56.450 --> 00:11:57.970
Of all the foolish...!

00:11:57.970 --> 00:12:01.680
What can one suit hope
to do against the Sandra?!

00:12:17.840 --> 00:12:19.540
I won't make excuses.

00:12:19.540 --> 00:12:22.250
I don't believe our loss
to the Gundam Team was...

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:26.310
an issue of the capabilities of our
machines or our piloting technique.

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:28.290
The issue was human.

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:30.340
In short, you want to say
that you were beaten...

00:12:30.340 --> 00:12:32.300
because you were
fighting Newtypes, Arius?

00:12:32.300 --> 00:12:34.130
Yes, and I believe
this Psyco Gundam...

00:12:34.380 --> 00:12:37.550
will allow me to counter
the Argama's Newtypes.

00:12:37.550 --> 00:12:38.970
No!

00:12:38.970 --> 00:12:40.770
Any normal human
who tries to operate...

00:12:40.770 --> 00:12:42.980
a psycommu-equipped
machine will lose their mind!

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:45.820
Quiet! We'll never
know unless we try!

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:50.320
Dana's correct. You'd be destroyed
before you ever got to fight.

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:52.990
The Psyco Gundam is
a severe machine.

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:54.280
I'm prepared to try!

00:12:54.280 --> 00:12:58.660
I can't use a valuable asset
like a laboratory experiment!

00:12:58.660 --> 00:13:02.000
Besides, I've already
chosen its pilot.

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:02.790
Before you do--

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:05.000
Enemy mobile suit,
approaching from ahead!

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:06.170
One unit!

00:13:06.170 --> 00:13:07.960
All hands, take level
one combat stations!

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:12.540
Arius, make the best
of your situation.

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:15.060
Do that and you'll
find a path forward.

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:17.770
Damn kid...!

00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:24.400
Okay, now to finish it before
it can launch any mobile suits!

00:13:26.020 --> 00:13:28.980
What's it doing?
Is it trying to ram us?!

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:30.110
Turn right!

00:13:31.210 --> 00:13:33.490
One direct hit on the
bridge will end this!

00:13:34.030 --> 00:13:35.950
I'm sorry, Glemy!

00:13:37.780 --> 00:13:40.000
Sh-Shoot it down!

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:51.300
I did it!
All right, now to finish it!

00:13:54.940 --> 00:13:57.090
You think one suit
can bring down a ship?!

00:13:57.090 --> 00:13:59.100
Fall! Fall!

00:14:01.450 --> 00:14:03.230
The Mk. II dares...?!

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:05.360
The enemy's behind you!

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:06.900
What?

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:09.780
I missed!

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:14.240
Whose voice
was that, just now?

00:14:17.050 --> 00:14:20.210
I... I... I'm falling!

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:22.880
Did it dodge by pure chance?!

00:14:23.930 --> 00:14:25.750
You're late!

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:33.800
My power won't hold
out if I keep this up!

00:14:33.800 --> 00:14:36.960
Steal an enemy Base Jabber!
It's your only chance!

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:38.840
Take an enemy Base Jabber...

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:41.730
Of course!
I understand, Judau!

00:14:42.950 --> 00:14:45.400
What?! It can still climb?!

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:54.110
Don't move or I'll shoot!

00:14:54.110 --> 00:14:55.190
D-Don't!

00:14:55.380 --> 00:14:57.280
They've boarded a Base Jabber?!

00:14:57.280 --> 00:14:59.990
Now what?
What do I do next?

00:14:59.990 --> 00:15:02.200
Now use that ship as a shield!

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:03.660
I understand, but...

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:10.420
You're using the
Sandra as a shield?!

00:15:12.310 --> 00:15:14.630
Stop! Are you trying to
destroy the Sandra?!

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:17.170
Enemy mobile suit, to our rear!

00:15:17.170 --> 00:15:20.380
What?! What's our mobile
suit unit doing?!

00:15:20.380 --> 00:15:23.060
Hah! Just try shooting
at me now!

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:27.610
Don't get too
confident, Mk. II!

00:15:32.120 --> 00:15:34.450
I'll cut you down
to size, Mk. II!

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:35.950
Get away!

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:41.790
It ran?

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:50.370
Confirming Argama, dead ahead!

00:15:50.370 --> 00:15:52.500
Bring us in over Dublin.

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:55.330
We'll smash the Argama
in one blow! Prepare to fire!

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:58.170
Enemy warship,
approaching harbor entrance!

00:15:58.170 --> 00:16:00.300
Launch! They'll pick us off!

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:01.800
Recalling Gundam Team!

00:16:01.800 --> 00:16:03.290
Hurry!

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:06.890
Judau! The Sandra's
approaching us! Get back here!

00:16:06.890 --> 00:16:08.180
But, what about Kamille?

00:16:08.180 --> 00:16:09.520
You can find him later!

00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:12.100
Gotcha! Dammit, why now?!

00:16:12.100 --> 00:16:13.990
Judau, head for the Sandra!

00:16:14.370 --> 00:16:17.060
The girl's in danger. Go now!

00:16:17.060 --> 00:16:21.370
Who was that just now?
Girl?!

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:31.420
I guess he's not here, either.
I need more than this photo...

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:34.580
Return! Go back!

00:16:34.580 --> 00:16:36.930
The girl in the
Mk. II is in danger!

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:38.180
But...!

00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:42.300
Iino, did you just
hear that voice?

00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:45.640
Yeah. Do you think
the girl in the Mk. II is...?

00:16:45.640 --> 00:16:46.810
C'mon!

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:52.230
My energy won't
hold out, at this rate!

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:58.360
I'm out of energy!

00:16:58.360 --> 00:17:00.620
Give up, Mk. II!

00:17:06.050 --> 00:17:08.450
All hands, evacuate! Run!

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:10.330
Ow...!

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:13.000
I won't let you stop the others!

00:17:20.900 --> 00:17:23.180
The Psyco Gundam's moving!

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:31.510
Wha... what is this?
This feeling...

00:17:31.510 --> 00:17:34.330
No! You'll be swallowed up
by that machine's aura!

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:36.030
Get away from it!

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:38.530
I have you!

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:46.700
They got my main camera!

00:17:57.220 --> 00:18:01.090
Judau... they beat me.

00:18:05.900 --> 00:18:07.970
The Mk. II isn't moving!

00:18:07.970 --> 00:18:10.520
Stay sharp!
It might be an act!

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:17.690
That's...
A part of the Double Zeta!

00:18:17.690 --> 00:18:18.480
I'll get it!

00:18:18.480 --> 00:18:20.780
Be careful! The back half's
probably here, too!

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:25.780
Ple, are you still alive?!

00:18:26.380 --> 00:18:29.000
J-Judau...

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:32.370
Ple, please answer me.
Ple!

00:18:32.800 --> 00:18:36.590
The girl isn't dead! Concentrate on
the enemies in front of you!

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:39.290
Why, you...!

00:18:49.530 --> 00:18:51.970
You may be slippery, but--

00:18:51.970 --> 00:18:52.900
What?!

00:18:54.740 --> 00:18:56.250
Iino! Elle!

00:18:56.250 --> 00:18:57.100
Judau!

00:18:57.100 --> 00:18:58.890
You can't take these
guys by yourself!

00:18:58.890 --> 00:19:01.450
Don't just yak at me!
We gotta dock!

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.690
Whatever it takes,
don't let them dock!

00:19:08.690 --> 00:19:09.540
Roger!

00:19:12.050 --> 00:19:13.070
We can't dock!

00:19:13.070 --> 00:19:15.830
Left!
Turn to the left!

00:19:15.830 --> 00:19:18.090
Elle! Iino! Turn left!

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:23.290
Don't let them escape!
Shoot them down, Dana!

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:24.180
Roger!

00:19:29.650 --> 00:19:31.600
Dammit! More reinforcements?!

00:19:33.110 --> 00:19:34.510
Roux! Beecha!

00:19:34.510 --> 00:19:35.810
Where were you?!

00:19:35.810 --> 00:19:37.060
Out of the way, guys!

00:19:37.060 --> 00:19:39.660
We'll handle the enemy!
Just hurry up and dock!

00:19:39.660 --> 00:19:42.700
Roger!
Elle, Iino, let's do it!

00:19:52.050 --> 00:19:54.500
Everyone, get back!
I'll finish this with one shot!

00:19:59.220 --> 00:20:01.640
I won't let you, Double Zeta!

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:03.670
Dana, get back here!
You can't take him alone!

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:06.390
Go, high mega-cannon!

00:20:15.820 --> 00:20:16.760
What happened?!

00:20:16.760 --> 00:20:18.760
It's no good!
We're losing power!

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:20.890
Portside gunports, inoperative!

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:21.560
What?

00:20:21.560 --> 00:20:24.160
Lord Glemy, at this rate...!

00:20:24.160 --> 00:20:26.980
The Argama is right in
front of us, but now...!

00:20:26.980 --> 00:20:28.360
Damn you, Double Zeta!

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:29.760
Lord Glemy!

00:20:29.760 --> 00:20:31.040
Retreat!

00:20:37.050 --> 00:20:39.920
They're leaving.
Where's Ple?!

00:20:45.730 --> 00:20:46.580
Ple!

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:47.760
Judau...

00:20:49.810 --> 00:20:52.650
Ple! Ple! Are you okay?

00:20:52.650 --> 00:20:53.380
Hey!

00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:55.260
Don't move her!

00:20:55.260 --> 00:20:56.530
Fa!

00:20:56.530 --> 00:20:58.940
You have to be gentle.

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:00.390
Fa...

00:21:00.390 --> 00:21:03.110
Don't speak. You're very tired.

00:21:03.870 --> 00:21:07.050
l know...

00:21:07.050 --> 00:21:09.280
Where Kamille is...

00:21:11.210 --> 00:21:13.790
Later.
You can tell me later.

00:21:14.630 --> 00:21:17.960
He's kind, isn't he?

00:21:18.300 --> 00:21:22.840
Because he kept talking to me,
all through the battle...!

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:26.030
You mean, that voice was Kamille's?

00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:27.680
l heard it, too.

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:31.800
That's right. We heard him too,
telling us to come here.

00:21:32.730 --> 00:21:37.380
Judau, hold me...
I can take you to him.

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:39.190
No! Don't strain yourself!

00:21:39.530 --> 00:21:42.690
It's okay. Judau, hurry!

00:21:43.410 --> 00:21:45.480
Sure. I understand.

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:54.990
Look, it's Kamille!

00:21:54.990 --> 00:21:57.370
Yeah, it is Kamille!
Over there!

00:22:04.430 --> 00:22:07.090
Kamille Bidan... the Newtype.

00:22:08.350 --> 00:22:11.180
Yes. Him.

00:22:14.730 --> 00:22:16.010
Kamille!

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:50.820
<i>ikuyaku ikuman ikuoku no hoshi yo
Hundreds upon thousands upon millions of stars...</i>

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:56.950
<i>naze hikaru dake nano ka kataru chikara no shiwase
...why do you just sit there and twinkle? Show me the power that lets me connect!</i>

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>Ima nara ore demo furikaerasu ni tobitatsu kokoro
For now, even I've got a mind that wanders without reminiscing past regrets!</i>

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:13.930
<i>Hoshi no kazu dake inochi wo takuwareba
If lives are really stored in the form of stars...</i>

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:19.940
<i>ginga no mure no hikari wo kaete misero
...show me how to change the light and move galaxies...</i>

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:29.650
<i>kono te ga tsukamu inochi no omosa ni naru
The weight of life itself, will be held in my hands!</i>

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:35.530
<i>mada meinai yo sora no michishirude wa
Space's guidepost is still not within my sights...</i>

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:41.620
<i>kono te ni saware hikari isenmanen
Let the light of 10 million years touch this hand!</i>

00:23:48.260 --> 00:23:50.460
The reason no one
knows a colony is falling...

00:23:50.460 --> 00:23:53.720
is because the Earth Federation
elite are covering it up!

00:23:53.720 --> 00:23:56.550
On our end, Hayato
gets himself killed,

00:23:56.550 --> 00:23:59.050
and we're barely able to
get anyone evacuated.

00:23:59.050 --> 00:24:03.230
This is hardly the time to be having
a totally awesome mobile-suit battle!

00:24:04.050 --> 00:24:07.470
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"Falling Sky."

00:24:05.810 --> 00:24:08.930
Next Time

00:24:05.810 --> 00:24:08.930
FALLING SKY

00:24:08.500 --> 00:24:09.560
Even Kamille saw it!
